        {
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "level": null,
          "content": "We present in this paper a theoretical framework to tackle the problem of water shortage in Saudi cities. The framework is based on the notion that city size and surrounding water resources should be matched, in order to avoid total dependency on external resources, which are costly, unsustainable and subject to interruptions in the long run.",
